+ * Power and volume-down come from the PMK8550 PON (SID 0, pon_hlos@1300,
+ * PON_RT_STS 0x10: KPDPWR bit0, RESIN bit1); volume-up is PMXR2230
+ * (SID 1) GPIO6 (pinctrl@8800, base 0x8800 + 6*0x100, PMIC_MPP_REG_RT_STS
+ * 0x10, active low). PMIC access is READ ONLY: the sole MMIO write issues
+ * EXT_READL on an observer channel. No config, IRQ acknowledge or reset.
  */
